32 paired cases; four radii per case; web exceptions/failures = 0
28 over tolerance, 4 within; new L2 matrix, no earlier L2 baseline. After correcting fractional crop origin: 32 -> 28 over tolerance.
Legacy component matrix is unchanged in scope; last verified W3.2c count 1398 / 1664, not remeasured in this layer.
Native backdrop and diagnostic labels are a common captured texture. Every material surface is shaded natively; no native text/layout parity is claimed by this L2 comparison.
Shaders: flat, gloss, frosted (separable Gaussian, 3 sigma support, float intermediates), glow (dark additive, light multiply, preserves alpha, clock/state/focus/particles).
Inspected: eight initial material squares; paired flat dark, gloss dark, glow dark. Gloss reads like the lab band. Residuals: edge AA/blending; frosted ring/highlight and colour/compositing; glow emitter geometry/phase and border/halo strength differ. Full pixel parity is not achieved.
No FPS measurements; no hosted CI, Linux/mobile or macOS 14-floor checks; no upper-layer Style/components or app input changes.
